 "text": "Hi, how have you been? A gentle spot is suitable, far from trees rooted in rock and windy. Give it a ten minute warm up first, so food isn't cold. Pop the bag open from the side, so the bolts aren't in your way. Light sandwich and a bottle of water are easy. Bring little plates and cutting boards for each other too. Find shelter and keep the fire going constantly. Move the food to the fire in a pot or a covered bowl.",
